1. You can SSH to your instance if you want to, see AWS SSH instructions.

2. The terminal in Rstudio is effectively the same as and SSH
connection. The error you are getting is because your working directory
of your shell is not a git repo. you need to change directory into a
repository 1st. Easiest way to do that, open an Rstudio project 1st,
from version control, giving it the github url.

Thanks,
Alex Mandel, PhD

Center for Spatial Sciences
  https://spatial.ucdavis.edu
Geospatial and Farming Systems Research Consortium
  https://gfc.ucdavis.edu
University of California, Davis

